+
+## Output format (强制 sentinel)
+每 step 完 echo "=== STEP N done ==="
+最后 echo "=== ALL DONE ==="
+最后 echo "CC DONE: $(date +%H:%M:%S)"
+```
+
+### GS-5: CC 沉淀 (v2.1.201, 7/24 mac)
+
+- `claude --bare -p` + `--add-dir` + `--allowedTools` 是 base 圣杯姿势
+- claude -p 默认 quiet → 派单必含 sentinel 协议
